{
    "_doc": "Public riverside park along the embankment. Minimal standalone faction: the world faction (Manageable_World) cannot own it - its only room is the world-map transit room, so a booking there would lead to that room, and world-map travel time is only measured between initializeFactions members with their own door. No floor plan: rooms are hideOnMap with no offsetX/offsetY, walking minutes as door cost (hospital pattern). No members and no staff.",
    "_doc_recreation": "Anyone may stroll here (jp_riverside_relax: generic 'recreation', ungated). Fireworks viewing (jp_riverside_watch_fireworks) is open while the fireworks offer is under way (its requireActiveRecreationOffer gate). Both are offers (MapPlans.recreationOffers below: recreation_offer_jp_riverside_fireworks on its festival dates, recreation_offer_jp_riverside_stroll daily, or a SetRecreationBooking event with one as template). No MemberTypes: a booked visit runs on its offer's own workModule - the default behavior tree sandboxes its workCommands (TryFindScheduledJobNode's booked-visit branch).",

