        "_comment_recreationOffers": "This venue's public activities (RecreationOfferDef) - every world that initializes jp_tourist_riverside collects them (WorldPlan.AllRecreationOffers). Template data, reloaded every game load, never saved. No MemberType: each visit runs on its offer's own workModule (the default behavior tree sandboxes its workCommands); behaviorOverrides / Tags / AcceptanceMods could be added per offer. Fireworks dates are placeholders to tune (two summer festivals).",
        "recreationOffers": [
